    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 用 SQL/PGQ 在库内追踪数据血缘",
      "summary": "数据血缘过去多靠外键加递归 CTE 拼凑，链路一长就难读懂。Cybertec 的 Hans-Jürgen Schönig 给出另一条路：在 PostgreSQL 19 里建一张 edge 表记录行级转换关系，用 CREATE PROPERTY GRAPH 声明属性图，再以 GRAPH_TABLE 用标准 SQL 查到报表。边标签自带语义，审计时比裸外键好解释；当前尚不支持可变长度路径，深层链路仍要用 WITH RECURSIVE。",
      "url": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/data-lineage-in-postgresql-19-finally-an-answer-when-the-cfo-asks-where-did-this-number-come-from/",
      "author": "Hans-Jürgen Schönig",
      "source": "Cybertec 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-28",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "SQL/PGQ",
        "数据血缘"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Fujitsu 公布 PostgreSQL 19 周期内的贡献清单",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 的逻辑复制改动有相当一部分出自同一支团队。Fujitsu 盘点了本轮成果：发布端排除指定表、序列的逻辑复制（经 ALTER SUBSCRIPTION … REFRESH SEQUENCES 同步）、update_deleted 冲突检测、按逻辑槽动态调整 wal_level，以及槽同步的跳过统计与失败重试。团队称本轮提交 83 个、审阅 81 个补丁。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.fastware.com/blog/highlights-of-fujitsu-contribution-in-postgresql-19",
      "author": "Hayato Kuroda",
      "source": "Fujitsu Enterprise Postgres 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-28",
      "image": "https://www.postgresql.fastware.com/hubfs/Images/Featured/Blog/img-featured-blog-highlights-of-fujitsu-contribution-in-postgresql-19.png",
      "domain": "pg",
